    "body": "As a follow-up (or here) we should also have something like this:\r\n\r\n```css\r\n::file-selector-button {\r\n  font-size: unset;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAt least that part matches all browsers:\r\n\r\n```\r\ndata:text/html,<input type=file style=\"font-size: 5px\">\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn Gecko we also unset [other things](https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/002023eb262be9db3479142355e1675645d52d52/layout/style/res/forms.css#690-695), not sure what Blink / WebKit do.",
